Package: com.iosvcam.audiobridge
Name: iOS-VCAM Audio Bridge
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Experimental OBS audio companion tweak for iOS-VCAM USB Audio Bridge. Injects framed PCM into AVFoundation audio capture callbacks when compatible.
Maintainer: iOS-VCAM
Author: iOS-VCAM
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), firmware (>= 15.0)
